<body>
<div class="mouse-spotlight"></div>
<div class="deck">
  <section class="slide active" data-slide="1">
    <div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:500px;height:500px;top:-120px;right:-100px;background:#F97316;opacity:.16"></div><div class="blob" style="width:340px;height:340px;bottom:-80px;left:-60px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.12"></div><div class="blob" style="width:220px;height:220px;top:42%;left:14%;background:#FEF3C7;opacity:.08"></div></div>
    <canvas class="particle-canvas" style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1" width="300" height="150"></canvas>
    <div class="content text-center">
      <div class="text-[120px] mb-5 animate-[float_3s_ease-in-out_infinite] reveal" style="transition: opacity 0.35s, transform 0.35s; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px);">🚘</div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5.2rem)] tracking-tight bg-linear-to-br from-accent-1 via-accent-2 to-accent-3 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4 reveal" style="transition: opacity 0.35s 0.08s, transform 0.35s 0.08s; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px);">Autoera AI</h1>
      <p class="text-[clamp(1rem,1.7vw,1.4rem)] text-text-secondary reveal" style="transition: opacity 0.35s 0.16s, transform 0.35s 0.16s; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px);">From $0 to a Billionaire-Scale Automotive AI Company</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[5px] text-text-muted reveal" style="transition: opacity 0.35s 0.24s, transform 0.35s 0.24s; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px);">Founder roadmap · product · market · capital · moats</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="2"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:350px;height:350px;top:-70px;right:-70px;background:#F97316;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:250px;height:250px;bottom:-60px;left:-40px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.06"></div></div><div class="content"><p class="uppercase tracking-[4px] text-text-muted mb-3 reveal">Core truth</p><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.1rem)] mb-8 reveal">You do not start with a billion-dollar company. You start with one painful workflow.</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6"><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-7 reveal"><div class="text-4xl mb-3">1</div><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Pick one wedge</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Target one narrow automotive use case where AI cuts cost, time, or risk immediately.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-7 reveal"><div class="text-4xl mb-3">2</div><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Sell before scaling</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Win paying pilots with dealers, fleets, marketplaces, lenders, or service networks before building a broad platform.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-7 reveal"><div class="text-4xl mb-3">3</div><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Layer moats later</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Data, workflow lock-in, integrations, compliance, and distribution become your moat after initial traction.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="3"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:380px;height:380px;top:-90px;right:-50px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:260px;height:260px;bottom:-80px;left:-50px;background:#F97316;opacity:.06"></div></div><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-8 reveal">Why automotive AI is attractive</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"><div class="space-y-5"><div class="border-l-4 border-accent-1 pl-5 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Large and expanding market</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">One market estimate places automotive AI at $19.1 billion in 2026, up from $15.8 billion in 2025, with long-run growth projected through 2035.</p></div><div class="border-l-4 border-accent-2 pl-5 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Immediate commercial payoff</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">BCG argues the biggest near-term AI gains in auto are in marketing and sales, where discovery, lead capture, pricing, and conversion can be improved fast.</p></div><div class="border-l-4 border-accent-1 pl-5 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl">Capital can follow traction</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Wayve raised more than $1 billion for automotive AI, showing investors will fund category leaders once technical ambition and commercial potential are proven.</p></div></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-3xl p-8 reveal"><div class="bar-chart"><div class="bar-col"><div class="bar bg-linear-to-t from-accent-1 to-accent-3" data-height="58" style="height:58%"></div><span class="text-sm">2025<br>$15.8B</span></div><div class="bar-col"><div class="bar bg-linear-to-t from-accent-2 to-accent-1" data-height="70" style="height:70%"></div><span class="text-sm">2026<br>$19.1B</span></div><div class="bar-col"><div class="bar bg-linear-to-t from-accent-1 to-accent-2" data-height="100" style="height:100%"></div><span class="text-sm">2035<br>$69.8B</span></div></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-text-muted">Illustrative sizing based on a published market forecast.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="4"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:340px;height:340px;top:-80px;right:-70px;background:#F97316;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:280px;height:280px;bottom:-70px;left:-40px;background:#FEF3C7;opacity:.07"></div></div><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-8 reveal">Best wedge options for Autoera AI</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Dealer and marketplace AI</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Inventory merchandising, lead qualification, pricing intelligence, AI sales assistant, financing pre-qualification, and service upsell workflows.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Fleet operations AI</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Maintenance prediction, driver support, route exceptions, claims triage, utilization optimization, and cost anomaly detection.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Aftermarket and service AI</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Repair estimate automation, parts recommendation, technician copilots, call-center automation, and customer retention triggers.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Embedded or autonomy stack</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">This can become huge, but it is the longest and most capital-intensive path, better as a later expansion unless you already have elite technical leverage.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="5"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:420px;height:420px;top:-100px;right:-90px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:230px;height:230px;bottom:-70px;left:-50px;background:#F97316;opacity:.07"></div></div><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-6 reveal">Phase 1: $0 to $100k</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="reveal border-l-4 border-accent-1 pl-4"><h3 class="font-bold">Talk to 50 customers</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Interview dealers, fleets, workshops, lenders, and marketplaces to find a repeated pain with measurable economic value.</p></div><div class="reveal border-l-4 border-accent-2 pl-4"><h3 class="font-bold">Choose one painful KPI</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Examples: lead response time, trade-in accuracy, service booking conversion, repair estimate cycle time, or maintenance downtime.</p></div><div class="reveal border-l-4 border-accent-1 pl-4"><h3 class="font-bold">Build concierge MVP</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Use no-code, APIs, and manual operations behind the scenes. The goal is results, not perfect automation.</p></div></div><div class="bg-bg-deep rounded-3xl p-8 border border-glass-border reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-2xl mb-4 text-glow">Target outcome</h3><ul class="space-y-3 text-text-secondary text-lg"><li>• 3 to 5 pilot customers</li><li>• First $5k to $20k MRR</li><li>• One repeatable ROI case study</li><li>• Clear proof that the pain is urgent</li></ul></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="6"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:380px;height:380px;top:-90px;right:-60px;background:#F97316;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:250px;height:250px;bottom:-80px;left:-30px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.06"></div></div><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-6 reveal">Phase 2: $100k to $1M</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">⚙️</div><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Productize</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Turn the concierge MVP into a reliable workflow product with dashboards, permissions, and integrations.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">📈</div><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Nail distribution</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Use outbound founder sales, channel partners, referral loops, and tightly defined ICP messaging.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔒</div><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Capture data moat</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Structure feedback loops, collect proprietary workflow data, and log decisions to improve model outputs.</p></div></div><p class="mt-8 text-xl text-text-secondary reveal">Your goal is not virality. It is 10x better unit economics for one customer segment.</p></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="7"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:360px;height:360px;top:-70px;right:-50px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:260px;height:260px;bottom:-70px;left:-60px;background:#FEF3C7;opacity:.06"></div></div><canvas class="particle-canvas" style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1" width="300" height="150"></canvas><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-8 reveal">Phase 3: $1M to $10M</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-5"><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-4xl font-display text-accent-1">01</div><p class="mt-3 text-text-secondary">Hire a strong product and engineering core.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-4xl font-display text-accent-2">02</div><p class="mt-3 text-text-secondary">Expand into adjacent workflows for the same buyer.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-4xl font-display text-accent-1">03</div><p class="mt-3 text-text-secondary">Build deeper APIs into CRMs, DMS, ERP, telematics, and finance tools.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><div class="text-4xl font-display text-accent-2">04</div><p class="mt-3 text-text-secondary">Raise seed or Series A only if capital clearly accelerates a proven engine.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="8"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:410px;height:410px;top:-90px;right:-80px;background:#F97316;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:240px;height:240px;bottom:-70px;left:-40px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.06"></div></div><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-8 reveal">Phase 4: $10M to $100M</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"><div class="space-y-5"><div class="reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">Create a platform, not point software</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Bundle workflow automation, intelligence, benchmarking, and decision support into one operating layer.</p></div><div class="reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">Win enterprise contracts</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Move upmarket into national dealer groups, fleet operators, lenders, insurers, or OEM-adjacent workflows.</p></div><div class="reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">Establish category authority</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Publish benchmarks, own industry data, and become the default system buyers compare against.</p></div></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-3xl p-8 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-2xl mb-5">The valuation jump happens when investors believe:</h3><ul class="space-y-4 text-lg text-text-secondary"><li>• Revenue can compound for years</li><li>• Churn is low because workflows are embedded</li><li>• Data improves the product faster than rivals</li><li>• Expansion revenue is natural, not forced</li></ul></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="9"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:350px;height:350px;top:-80px;right:-60px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.08"></div><div class="blob" style="width:250px;height:250px;bottom:-80px;left:-50px;background:#F97316;opacity:.06"></div></div><div class="content"><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] mb-8 reveal">Phase 5: $100M+ to billionaire outcome</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-3">Own a layer of the ecosystem</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Become indispensable in automotive commerce, fleet ops, servicing, or AI-enabled mobility infrastructure.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-3">Compound through acquisitions</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">Buy tools, data assets, or channels that deepen your workflow dominance and widen your moat.</p></div><div class="bg-glass-bg backdrop-blur-xl border border-glass-border rounded-2xl p-6 reveal"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-3">Reach liquidity at scale</h3><p class="text-text-secondary">A billionaire outcome usually comes from meaningful equity ownership plus very large enterprise value, not just salary or consulting income.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="slide" data-slide="10"><div class="gradient-mesh"><div class="blob" style="width:440px;height:440px;top:-110px;right:-80px;background:#F97316;opacity:.10"></div><div class="blob" style="width:300px;height:300px;bottom:-90px;left:-60px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:.09"></div><div class="blob" style="width:220px;height:220px;top:45%;left:12%;background:#FEF3C7;opacity:.07"></div></div><canvas class="particle-canvas" style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1" width="300" height="150"></canvas><div class="content text-center"><div class="text-[100px] mb-5 animate-[float_3s_ease-in-out_infinite] reveal">🏁</div><h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4.4rem)] bg-linear-to-br from-accent-1 via-accent-2 to-accent-3 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4 reveal">Start narrow. Win hard. Expand carefully.</h2><p class="text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal">The fastest path for Autoera AI is a painful commercial wedge first, platform expansion second, and category ownership third.</p></div></section>
</div>
<div class="nav-controls"><button class="nav-btn" aria-label="Previous slide">‹</button><div class="slide-dots" id="dots"><div class="dot active"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div></div><button class="nav-btn" aria-label="Next slide">›</button><span class="slide-counter" id="counter">1 / 10</span></div>



</body></html>
